  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk  | Bedford, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Boards & Commissions   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Business   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \nStay Informed \nGet news and updates sent right to your phone or inbox! \r\n\t\t\t Sign up for Notifications \r\n\t\t\t Bedford Town Profile \r\n\t\t\t Bedford Community Organizations \r\n\t\t\t Annual Reports \r\n\t\t\t Cemeteries \r\n\t\t\t Charter & Code of Ordinances \r\n\t\t\t Election Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Voter Registration \r\n\t\t\t\t Application Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Determining Applicant Qualifications \r\n\t\t\t\t Filing for Office \r\n\t\t\t\t Candidates for Office \r\n\t\t\t\t ELECTION TRAFFIC \r\n\t\t\t\t Town Moderator Announcements \r\n\t\t\t\t Public Notice - Electronic Ballot Counting Device Testing \r\n\t\t\t\t Public Notice - Ballot Counting \r\n\t\t\t\t Legal Notice Protest Petition \r\n\t\t\t Elected Officials List \r\n\t\t\t Fee Schedule \r\n\t\t\t Frequently Asked Questions \r\n\t\t\t Hunting & Fishing Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration FAQs \r\n\t\t\t New Residents \r\n\t\t\t Tax Collector \r\n\t\t\t Town Clerk \r\nHome \nDepartments \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk \t\t \r\nThe Town Clerk's Office is responsible for the recording and management of all vital records involving births, marriages, and deaths occurring in the Town. The Office also conducts all local, state and federal elections; issues types of licenses including dog licenses and pawnbroker's license. The Town Clerk's Office maintains many of the Town's most important records. \nELECTIONS \nDOG LICENSES \nMARRIAGE LICENSES \nVITAL RECORDS \nSTUDENT PARKING \nONLINE PAYMENTS \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tBill Carter\r\nTown Clerk \r\ntownclerk@bedfordnh.gov  \r\nMore Information \r\n\t\t\t\t\tPaula Talmanson\r\nDeputy Town Clerk \r\nEmail  \r\nMore Information \r\nPhysical Address \n24 N Amherst Rd \nBedford, NH 03110 \nPhone: 603-472-3550 x2 \nFax: 603-472-4573 \nHours \nMonday, Wednesday - Friday \n8:00AM - 4:30PM \nTuesdays \n7:00AM - 3:30PM \nQuick Links \r\n         Charter and Code of Ordinances \n         List of Elected Officials (PDF) \n         Statement of Landlord's Agent (PDF) \n         View All \r\n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & \nMeetings \r\n\t\t\t Maps & \nProperty \nInformation \r\n\t\t\t Online \nPayments \r\n\t\t\t Transfer \nStation & \nRecycling \r\n\t\t\t Licenses \n& Permits \r\n\t\t\t Job \nOpenings \r\nContact Us \r\nBedford Town Offices \r\n24 North Amherst Road \r\nBedford, NH 03110 \nPhone:  603-472-5242 \r\nStaff Directory \r\nTown Offices Hours \r\nMonday through Friday: \n8 am to 4:30 pm \nTuesday: \n7 am to 4:30 pm \r\nTransfer Station Hours \r\nSunday and Monday: \nClosed \nTuesday: \n7 am to 5 pm \nWednesday and Friday: \n8:30 am to 5 pm \nThursday: \n8:30 am to 7 pm \nSaturday: \n6:30 am to 3 pm \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Government Websites by CivicPlus® \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
